  "description": "QueryMaker is a .NET library built from the ground up using LINQ Expressions which provides the tools for making complex queries in a dynamic fashion via simple components. This components allow for performing multi-layered filtering with automatic type conversions, sorting with multiple fields and directions, paging using an index, selecting specified fields and DistinctBy multiple fields.",
